{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01277",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.01,
      "end_seconds": 5.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "hi doctor, you know, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.71,
      "end_seconds": 10.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.27,
      "end_seconds": 15.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "I wanted to get skipped beats looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.4,
      "end_seconds": 19.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.43,
      "end_seconds": 23.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Probably three days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.78,
      "end_seconds": 33.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.17,
      "end_seconds": 62.33,
      "duration_seconds": 27.16,
      "text": "Yes, lying down. That makes it worse. It feels moderate to me. Honestly, a couple of times a week. I've also had being a bit anxious. As for being a bit anxious, it feels mild to me. There was a flutter in my chest, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.1,
      "end_seconds": 70.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "alright, have you had skipped beats before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.99,
      "end_seconds": 76.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "A bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.53,
      "end_seconds": 91.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "A few quick ones: dizziness or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.48,
      "end_seconds": 96.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.28,
      "end_seconds": 101.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Any chest pain or shortness of breath at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.02,
      "end_seconds": 107.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "No chest pain or shortness of breath, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.72,
      "end_seconds": 110.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.97,
      "end_seconds": 113.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.59,
      "end_seconds": 117.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.37,
      "end_seconds": 121.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.22,
      "end_seconds": 143.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Alright, which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.05,
      "end_seconds": 154.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "Diclofenac. I take it it 50 milligrams, when needed for the joint pain. Herbal calming tea, in the evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.49,
      "end_seconds": 159.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.59,
      "end_seconds": 165.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I've, I've got arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.5,
      "end_seconds": 167.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.11,
      "end_seconds": 173.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "I've had heart failure for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.15,
      "end_seconds": 182.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.28,
      "text": "right, so arthritis in your knees and heart failure are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.59,
      "end_seconds": 199.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Alright, how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.33,
      "end_seconds": 205.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.48,
      "end_seconds": 214.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.47,
      "end_seconds": 218.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.72,
      "end_seconds": 221.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "alright, and your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.65,
      "end_seconds": 226.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.8,
      "end_seconds": 231.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "alright, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.5,
      "end_seconds": 234.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.96,
      "end_seconds": 240.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.78,
      "end_seconds": 249.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.4,
      "end_seconds": 269.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, heart rate 73, pressure 126 over 77, temp 37.0 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.92,
      "end_seconds": 274.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.5,
      "end_seconds": 279.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.11,
      "end_seconds": 286.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "I'd like to to check you over now, if that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.24,
      "end_seconds": 290.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.27,
      "end_seconds": 308.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Your pulse is regular and your heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.49,
      "end_seconds": 350.82,
      "duration_seconds": 38.33,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. From what you've told me and what I found, I'd lean towards harmless extra heartbeats. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out an anxiety-related palpitation yet. We should do an ECG for palpitations. Cut back on coffee and energy drinks and keep a diary of when it happens. If you faint or have chest pain, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.11,
      "end_seconds": 355.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.17,
      "end_seconds": 362.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Book a review if it carries on after a month. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.12,
      "end_seconds": 367.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "thank you, that's helpful"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.03,
      "end_seconds": 370.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}